WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,220
I should respect you

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:03,810
You are interested

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:08,860
Are you and that girl from Shen Laosi's family serious?

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:11,720
Just wait until the house is built

5
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:13,820
That girl is diligent and sensible

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:15,020
treat her well

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,020
Do you need help building a house?

8
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,220
Tell Grandpa San

9
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,020
Thank you, Third Grandpa. I’m leaving first.

10
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:22,020
I still have to go to Grandma Zhao and Grandpa Sun’s house

11
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:30,040
Your uncle Wang said

12
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:33,220
Qin Youlu and the others usually don't do serious business.

13
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:35,310
Someone really came to check

14
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:38,310
Your Uncle Wang will prove your innocence

15
00:00:38,510 --> 00:00:41,110
Thank you, Aunt Wang. I understand and I will leave first.

16
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:47,590
Wang Tiezhu’s attitude is clear

17
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:53,920
The old people are also on my side, Brother Qin

18
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,320
The village said Qin Youlu and they were out to sue you.

19
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,220
Xiao Xi believes me

20
00:00:58,620 --> 00:00:59,720
We didn't do anything bad
